  "description": "Two days before the wedding, the bride vanished. The fake bride, in place of her missing twin sister, was \nBaek Yi-Rim, a scapegoat for the Baekhwa Group and a \"husband-eating woman.\" \n\nYi-Rim, who had been nothing more than a half-day stand-in, unintentionally ended up spending the night with Levi K. Gray. The man, who had known from the beginning that the bride was fake, smiled a breathtakingly dangerous smile. \n\n\"Just enjoy yourself, like last night. Until the real one returns.\"\n\n\"Let's do it one more time. We'll repent when the time comes.\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12870212), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1632013643), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/70754856), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260694)    \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12870570), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1632013706), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/70755029)",
